###Request
POST https://Testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/checkinmicroservice/CheckIn/savePassport HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.passengerId == 'transaction-summary-passport')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "onlineCheckInStatus": {
    "available": false,
    "code": "passport-advisory",
    "message": "Check-in cannot continue."
  }
